---
import PublicLayout from '../../layouts/PublicLayout.astro';
---
<PublicLayout fullTitle="November Job Ownership Worksheet | Organized Family Club" description="Create a personalized family job handoff worksheet and save a two-page, double-sided PDF." indexable={false} chrome={false} width="full">
<main class="gen-shell">
  <div class="gen-top"><a href="/club/" class="back">← Organized Family Club</a><span class="eyebrow">November · Foundation · Prototype</span></div>
  <div class="intro">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">One problem. One ready-to-use tool.</p><h1>Give the whole job <em>to someone else.</em></h1><p>Choose one recurring job. Make the expectations clear. Give your family a plan you can print, use, and put on the fridge.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="workspace">
    <section class="controls" aria-label="Personalize your worksheet">
      <h2>Make it yours</h2>
      <label>Family name<input id="family" value="The Goering Family" maxlength="55" autocomplete="off"/></label>
      <label>Who will own the job?<input id="owner" value="Andrew" maxlength="42" autocomplete="off"/></label>
      <label>Age (optional)<input id="age" type="number" min="2" max="99" value="8" /></label>
      <label>Choose a job<select id="job"><option value="Set and clear the dinner table">Set and clear the dinner table</option><option value="Pack my school bag each evening">Pack my school bag each evening</option><option value="Put away clean laundry">Put away clean laundry</option><option value="Empty the dishwasher">Empty the dishwasher</option><option value="Keep the entryway tidy">Keep the entryway tidy</option><option value="custom">Write my own job…</option></select></label>
      <label id="custom-wrap" hidden>Custom job<input id="custom" maxlength="90" placeholder="The whole job, not just one step"/></label>
      <label>When does it happen?<input id="when" value="After dinner, every evening" maxlength="90"/></label>
      <label>What does finished look like?<textarea id="done" rows="3" maxlength="280">Dishes moved to the sink, table wiped, chairs pushed in, and supplies put away.</textarea></label>
      <label>First check-in date<input id="checkin" type="date"/></label>
      <p class="privacy">This prototype runs in your browser. Your entries are not saved or sent to a server.</p>
      <button type="button" class="print" id="print">Print / Save as PDF ↗</button>
      <p class="helper">Choose <strong>Save as PDF</strong> in your print dialog. Print double-sided on one 8.5 × 11 sheet, flip on long edge. For flat mailing, do not fold.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="preview" aria-label="Print preview"><div class="preview-heading"><h2>Your two-sided worksheet</h2><span>8.5 × 11 in · 2 pages</span></div>
      <div id="print-document">
        <article class="sheet" aria-label="Page 1, worksheet">
          <div class="print-head"><span class="month">November</span><span class="identity">ORGANIZED FAMILY CLUB</span></div>
          <div class="sheet-inner">
            <p class="eyebrow">Family ownership · Month 11</p>
            <h2 class="sheet-title">I own this job.</h2>
            <p class="sheet-deck">One whole job. One clear owner. Less reminding for everyone.</p>
            <div class="gray-panel"><span class="panel-label">PREPARED FOR</span><strong data-fill="family"></strong><span class="panel-sub">A small step toward a home where everyone plays a part.</span></div>
            <div class="rule-section"><div class="section-band">01 &nbsp; THE JOB</div><div class="field-label">THIS JOB BELONGS TO</div><div class="filled" data-fill="owner"></div><div class="field-label">MY JOB IS</div><div class="filled" data-fill="job"></div><div class="field-label">WHEN IT HAPPENS</div><div class="filled" data-fill="when"></div></div>
            <div class="rule-section"><div class="section-band">02 &nbsp; DONE LOOKS LIKE</div><div class="written" data-fill="done"></div><div class="dot-lines" aria-hidden="true"></div></div>
            <div class="rule-section"><div class="section-band">03 &nbsp; THE HANDOFF</div><div class="handoff"><div><b>1</b><strong>SHOW IT</strong><small>Watch someone do the whole job.</small></div><div><b>2</b><strong>DO IT TOGETHER</strong><small>Practice until the steps are clear.</small></div><div><b>3</b><strong>HAND IT OVER</strong><small>The owner does it and notices when it is needed.</small></div><div><b>4</b><strong>CHECK IN</strong><small>Talk about how it went, then adjust.</small></div></div></div>
            <p class="sheet-footer">ORGANIZED MOM COLLECTIVE <span>01 / 02</span></p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="sheet" aria-label="Page 2, coaching and follow-through">
          <div class="print-head"><span class="month">November</span><span class="identity">OUR FAMILY, OUR TEAM</span></div>
          <div class="sheet-inner">
            <p class="eyebrow">A note for your family</p><h2 class="sheet-title">Helping is good.<br/><em>Owning is better.</em></h2>
            <p class="letter">When one person has to notice every job, ask for help, and check that it got done, the responsibility never really moves. This month, give someone the entire job. Start with one. Show them what done looks like, practice together, then give them room to learn.</p>
            <p class="letter">The goal isn't perfection. It's a home where everyone can see what's needed and take responsibility for their part.</p>
            <div class="rule-section"><div class="section-band">THIS WEEK'S FAMILY CHECK-IN</div><p class="prompt">What worked? What was hard? What should we change?</p><div class="dot-lines tall" aria-hidden="true"></div><p class="checkdate">Let's check in again: <strong data-fill="checkin"></strong></p></div>
            <div class="rule-section"><div class="section-band">TRY IT TOGETHER</div><div class="checks"><p>□ We agreed on what finished means.</p><p>□ We practiced it together.</p><p>□ The owner knows when to do it.</p><p>□ We will check in without constant reminders.</p></div></div>
            <div class="note"><span class="panel-label">BRING IT TO YOUR CALENDAR</span><p>Write the owner's name beside the day or routine. Then let the calendar do some of the reminding.</p></div>
            <p class="signoff">Cheering you on,<br/><em>Megan</em></p>
            <p class="sheet-footer">ORGANIZED MOM COLLECTIVE <span>02 / 02</span></p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>
<script>
  const el = (id: string) => document.getElementById(id) as HTMLInputElement;
  const fields = ['family','owner','age','job','custom','when','done','checkin'];
  const update = () => {
    const custom = el('job').value === 'custom';
    const customWrap = document.getElementById('custom-wrap');
    if (customWrap) customWrap.hidden = !custom;
    const job = custom ? el('custom').value : el('job').value;
    const checkin = el('checkin').value;
    const values: Record<string,string> = {
      family: el('family').value || 'Your family',
      owner: el('owner').value || 'Our new owner',
      job: job || 'Our chosen household job',
      when: el('when').value || 'We will decide together',
      done: el('done').value || 'Write together what finished looks like.',
      checkin: checkin ? new Date(checkin + 'T12:00:00').toLocaleDateString('en-US',{month:'long',day:'numeric',year:'numeric'}) : '____________________',
    };
    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-fill]').forEach(node => { node.textContent = values[node.dataset.fill || ''] || ''; });
  };
  fields.forEach(id => el(id)?.addEventListener('input',update));
  el('job').addEventListener('change',update);
  el('print').addEventListener('click',()=>{ update();window.print(); });
  update();
</script>
<style>
.gen-shell{max-width:1510px;margin:auto;padding:24px clamp(16px,3vw,52px) 70px;color:#545454;font-family:'Montserrat Variable',Montserrat,sans-serif}
.gen-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;align-items:center}.back{font-size:12px;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}.eyebrow,.panel-label,.field-label,.identity{font-size:10px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:.19em;text-transform:uppercase}.intro{max-width:800px;padding:46px 0 38px}.intro h1{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,64px);line-height:1.05;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:12px 0 20px}.intro h1 em{font-weight:400}.intro p:last-child{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;max-width:650px}
.workspace{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(270px,355px) minmax(0,1fr);align-items:start;gap:clamp(18px,3vw,44px)}
.controls{background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #ddd;padding:26px;position:sticky;top:16px}.controls h2,.preview-heading h2{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:400;margin:0 0 20px}.controls label{display:grid;gap:6px;font-size:11px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:.06em;margin-bottom:16px}.controls input,.controls textarea,.controls select{width:100%;background:white;border:1px solid #bbb;border-radius:0;padding:11px 12px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:normal;font-weight:400;color:#333}.controls :focus-visible{outline:2px solid #545454;outline-offset:2px}.controls textarea{resize:vertical}.controls [hidden]{display:none}.print{background:#545454;color:white;padding:16px;width:100%;font-weight:650;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer}.privacy,.helper{font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#666}.preview-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px}.preview-heading span{font-size:11px}
#print-document{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,390px),1fr));gap:24px;align-items:start}.sheet{aspect-ratio:8.5/11;background:white;box-shadow:0 8px 32px #0002;border:1px solid #e1e1e1;min-width:0;color:#545454;container-type:inline-size}.print-head{height:7.5%;background:#d0e1e4;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 6%;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa}.month{font:italic 5.5cqw Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:.06em}.identity{font-size:1.7cqw;letter-spacing:.16em}.sheet-inner{height:92.5%;padding:4.2% 6% 2.5%;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.sheet-inner>.eyebrow{font-size:1.65cqw;letter-spacing:.15em}.sheet-title{font:normal 7cqw/1.04 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:2.4% 0 1.5%}.sheet-deck{font-size:2cqw;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 4%}.gray-panel{background:#f5f5f5;padding:3%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1cqw;border:1px solid #c8c8c8}.panel-label{font-size:1.55cqw}.gray-panel strong{font:normal 4.4cqw Georgia,serif}.panel-sub{font-size:1.7cqw;line-height:1.4}.rule-section{border:1px solid #aaa;margin-top:3%}.section-band{background:#d0e1e4;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;font-size:1.8cqw;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:.18em;padding:1.7% 2.5%}.field-label{font-size:1.55cqw;padding:2.5% 2.5% .5%}.filled{padding:0 2.5% 2%;border-bottom:1px solid #d5d5d5;font-size:2.2cqw;line-height:1.35;min-height:3cqw}.rule-section .filled:last-child{border-bottom:0}.written{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:2cqw;line-height:1.55;padding:2% 2.5%;min-height:7cqw}.dot-lines{height:7cqw;margin:0 2.5% 2%;background-image:radial-gradient(#c2c2c2 .5px,transparent .7px);background-size:7px 12px}.handoff{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}.handoff>div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.9cqw;padding:2.5cqw 1cqw;text-align:center;border-right:1px solid #ddd}.handoff>div:last-child{border:0}.handoff b{display:grid;place-items:center;margin:auto;width:4.5cqw;height:4.5cqw;border-radius:50%;background:#d0e1e4;font-size:2cqw}.handoff strong{font-size:1.7cqw;letter-spacing:.04em}.handoff small{font:1.9cqw/1.35 Georgia,serif}.sheet-footer{margin-top:auto;border-top:1px solid #aaa;padding-top:1.3%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:1.4cqw;letter-spacing:.14em}.letter{font:2.5cqw/1.55 Georgia,serif;margin:3% 0}.prompt{font:2.35cqw/1.4 Georgia,serif;padding:1% 2.5%;margin:0}.dot-lines.tall{height:13cqw}.checkdate{font-size:1.9cqw;margin:1.8% 2.5%}.checks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 2%;padding:1.5% 2%}.checks p{font-size:1.8cqw;line-height:1.4;margin:2% 0}.note{background:#f5f5f5;padding:3%;margin-top:4%;border:1px solid #ccc}.note p{font:2.25cqw/1.5 Georgia,serif;margin:2% 0 0}.signoff{font:2.3cqw/1.4 Georgia,serif;margin:3% 0}.signoff em{font-size:3.6cqw}
@media(max-width:850px){.workspace{grid-template-columns:1fr}.controls{position:static}.intro{padding:35px 0}.preview-heading{margin:12px 0}}
@page{size:letter;margin:0}
@media print{
 html,body{margin:0!important;padding:0!important;background:white!important;print-color-adjust:exact!important;-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact!important}
 body *{visibility:hidden!important}
 #print-document,#print-document *{visibility:visible!important}
 #print-document{position:absolute!important;inset:0 auto auto 0!important;display:block!important;width:8.5in!important;margin:0!important;padding:0!important;gap:0!important}
 #print-document .sheet{width:8.5in!important;height:11in!important;aspect-ratio:auto!important;break-after:page!important;page-break-after:always!important;margin:0!important;padding:0!important;border:0!important;box-shadow:none!important;overflow:hidden!important;container-type:inline-size!important}
 #print-document .sheet:last-child{break-after:auto!important;page-break-after:auto!important}
}
</style>
</PublicLayout>